{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_02_044_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:0ef3d14d52477d612267acf18c669adac38ece7c9c30d43081bdfa9c377d751e",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_02_044_22:5_02_044_22_a:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e7957f1184e51a0b4355d3d49275e67b2caad6629eb867dd15e38ffd18922632",
      "text": "来啦，制作人。\n我等你很久了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_044_22:5_02_044_22_a:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:46ddcb6e39af7ab9679555eea14e28eda0152207f4a0d6465c0c38ed90778598",
      "text": "把这个收下吧。\n是白色情人节的礼物。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_044_22:5_02_044_22_a:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e92f720f777e218aaea26941be0f4baea675f597d21a3d45aa60c68e4dd91914",
      "text": "哪里，虽然想客套一句不是什么大不了的东西……\n不过这可是我照着自己的想法挑出的逸品哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_044_22:5_02_044_22_a:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fe2a1f319cdb1b3ee423cfc3de4522811d1c674e81f3ba9e72d640a40b003296",
      "text": "里面是什么拆开前可要保密。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_044_22:5_02_044_22_a:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:93142f1df6aa0335dc584aa87e86c71c9f417f49b3ce293416962209572168e2",
      "text": "要是能配得上你的这番真心就好啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_044_22:5_02_044_22_b:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e344ed1f1dce6ea9444ddc4ba915ed1b61ae7207987e3aff1eae009329036f3f",
      "text": "啊啊，欢迎回来。因为有东西想交给你，\n我稍微在这等了一会儿呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_044_22:5_02_044_22_b:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eb9e520ac9bf0df6ca66b1abb3780f0b28f72637dd729c775c74a9ca6bbb2d28",
      "text": "来。把这个收下吧。\n是情人节巧克力的谢礼。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_044_22:5_02_044_22_b:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ecd32bdba8d3e53d467a09d6e923bf5e847a559d81a8222c0c7e1d38d7ca2d7",
      "text": "为了能保佑你的工作一切顺利，\n我还附带了一点小小的法术哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_044_22:5_02_044_22_b:cmd-000028:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ed80afae461dfb9f27232fe9e7e1dcf219cb7b1e7e1fd027630111dac704e080",
      "text": "小法术……感觉会很灵验呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_044_22:5_02_044_22_b:cmd-000029:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4e37e1fdc8829e0c8e1cc3642c7974d7d52a4320a42e361ecbbcaab10f308448",
      "text": "好开心。非常感谢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_044_22:5_02_044_22_b:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4143f64d1fca0b3a948b24a0efc3a10f5a2f702427aa42c1365882ea5f5bedb4",
      "text": "有多灵验可全凭你自己的造化了。\n嘛，你能高兴就比什么都好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_044_22:5_02_044_22_b:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:30e329a095511d02b3c5c13850137f87d7070daa5925235ba77df77979515ede",
      "text": "哈哈，你能这么高兴的话，\n我也算没有白挑一番了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_044_22:5_02_044_22_b:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:64cfb0e8b33ae9bc67e416284f8fcfef949f1cbed6e0e0b30a4dd856f59bd2ca",
      "text": "情人节时你所说的那些话的含义，\n我如今全都有所体会了哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_044_22:5_02_044_22_b:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f3f9f37a09a987bcf2f9591fd48052612487e04e6810acd9a3edbdae8f9c85f0",
      "text": "为了回应对方的心意而琢磨挑选礼物的这段时间，\n还真是挺美妙的呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_044_22:5_02_044_22_b:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4151ae3ef4b4e34516d972ee3ca3294fc6172d70c90dc59d42ceca3c7a247ddb",
      "text": "今后也请多指教啦。\n●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
